window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>In K. J. Parker's whip-smart dark fantasy, a group of scholars must do the impossible for a ruthless king. The cost of refusal, of course, is death.</b></p> <p>History isn't truth; it's propaganda.</p> <p>Seeking war with his neighbor, the tyrannical ruler of Aelia convenes several of his kingdom's professors for a chat. First Citizen Gyges only just invaded Aelia a few years back, and naturally, his public image can't take the hit of another unjustified assault.</p> <p>His totally sane solution? Simple, really. These scholars must construct a fake ancient city from scratch to verify Gyges's apocryphal claims.</p> <p>Now these academics must put their heads together to make history. Because if they don't, they'll lose their heads altogether.</p>"; 
